  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      63.97,
      129.31,
      538.33,
      212.06
    ],
    "text": "The accused-appellant was indicted before the High Court of Matara for committing robbery of cash Rs.75,OOO/-and cigarettes valued at Rs. 14,560/-from the possession of Munidasa Thabrew on or about the 14th January 2003 with unknown persons whilst being armed, an offence",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.90850830078125,
      13.615734100341797,
      13.854055404663086,
      13.882370948791504,
      13.995462417602539,
      14.07933521270752,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.160271644592285,
      14.210368156433105,
      14.239212989807129,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      65.01,
      214.04,
      522.8,
      233.42
    ],
    "text": "punishable under section 383 read with section 32 of the Penal Code.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.160271644592285,
      14.69446849822998
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      64.26,
      238.75,
      537.71,
      305.18
    ],
    "text": "After trial the learned High Court Judge by his judgment dated 25th June 2013 convicted the accused-appellant and sentenced him to a term of 10 years R.I. A fine of Rs.l0,OOO/- and in lieu 6 months R.I. Aggrieved by the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.063946723937988,
      13.544768333435059,
      13.890138626098633,
      14.084892272949219,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.114842414855957,
      14.133909225463867,
      14.166194915771484,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.424858093261719,
      14.560287475585938,
      14.57993221282959
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      64.65,
      306.92,
      537.35,
      347.42
    ],
    "text": "said conviction and sentence the accused-appellant had preferred this appeal to this court.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.0745267868042,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.446785926818848
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      63.99,
      357.32,
      538.29,
      376.7
    ],
    "text": "The main contention of the Counsel for the accused-appellant was that",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.215526580810547,
      14.39609146118164,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      64.49,
      378.67,
      537.81,
      440.77
    ],
    "text": "the learned trial Judge erred in law by concluding that the identification of the accused-appellant was established beyond reasonable ground on laid down legal criteria.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.981653213500977,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.346545219421387,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      64.57,
      450.67,
      537.16,
      470.05
    ],
    "text": "According to the prosecution this robbery had taken place at a road side",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.446785926818848
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      65.25,
      471.55,
      536.94,
      490.93
    ],
    "text": "boutique around 7.00 p.m on the 14th of January which was a Thaipongal",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.686434745788574,
      14.095749855041504,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.424858093261719
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      65.14,
      493.15,
      536.46,
      512.53
    ],
    "text": "day. The boutique owner witness No. 1 Thabrew, his uncle and",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      64.79,
      514.51,
      537.29,
      554.77
    ],
    "text": "employees Thilak and Sarath together with several customers and witness No.4 Ariyawansha had been present at that time. Three persons",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.113143920898438,
      14.222270011901855,
      14.2811861038208
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      65.14,
      556.76,
      538.45,
      597.24
    ],
    "text": "had arrived on a motor bike. The bike was parked outside the boutique and one had pushed the customers inside and had stood guard outside",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.293868064880371
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      65.03,
      599.23,
      538.17,
      681.73
    ],
    "text": "whilst another robbed the cashiers till and cigarettes. Thereafter all had left. One of them had shot into the air when leaving. According to the prosecution witnesses the whole incident had taken only 5 to 10 minutes.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.124728202819824,
      14.1548433303833,
      14.16305923461914,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.312399864196777,
      14.446785926818848,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      297.3,
      731.31,
      304.8,
      744.65
    ],
    "text": "2",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.27,
      70.64,
      535.81,
      90.16
    ],
    "text": "Two months later the accused-appellant had been arrested and",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.199999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.93,
      91.34,
      536.92,
      111.28
    ],
    "text": "Identification Parade held on 2pt March, 2003. Witness Nol Thabrew",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.199999809265137,
      14.899999618530273,
      15.253890991210938,
      15.815946578979492
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.45,
      113.38,
      536.58,
      153.76
    ],
    "text": "and witness No.4 Ariyawansha had participated at the Parade where the accused-appellant had been identified.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.199999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.03,
      163.76,
      537.53,
      204.4
    ],
    "text": "The witness Thabrew whilst giving evidence in court had admitted the fact that prior to the holding of the Identification Parade in courts on 2pt",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100752830505371,
      14.129173278808594,
      14.199999809265137,
      14.227672576904297,
      14.39732837677002,
      14.631542205810547,
      14.746484756469727,
      15.73249340057373
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.56,
      205.82,
      536.92,
      246.89
    ],
    "text": "March 2003, the accused-appellant was seen by him at the Hiniduma police station. Therefore the learned trial Judge had quite correctly",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.199999809265137,
      14.227672576904297,
      14.308287620544434,
      14.899999618530273
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.46,
      248.74,
      536.23,
      268.25
    ],
    "text": "disregarded the evidence of the said witness regarding the identity of the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.199999809265137,
      14.227672576904297,
      14.475919723510742,
      14.611827850341797
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.05,
      270.09,
      535.6,
      310.72
    ],
    "text": "accused-appellant. But the learned trial Judge had carefully considered the evidence led in this case and had held that the witness Ariyawansha",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.964496612548828,
      14.100752830505371,
      14.199999809265137,
      14.227672576904297,
      14.331738471984863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.22,
      312.56,
      536.71,
      374.32
    ],
    "text": "had sufficient time and light to identify the accused-appellant. The learned trial Judge state's that even if the Identification Parade evidence of the accused-appellant is not considered with regard to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.580537796020508,
      14.199999809265137,
      14.210396766662598,
      14.224827766418457,
      14.227672576904297,
      14.331738471984863,
      14.4979248046875,
      14.611827850341797,
      14.631542205810547,
      14.641098976135254
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.8,
      375.92,
      535.43,
      416.55
    ],
    "text": "identification by witness Thabrew, the charges however have been proved.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.199999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.93,
      426.57,
      536.83,
      446.09
    ],
    "text": "It is the contention of the Counsel for the accused-appellant that the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.580537796020508,
      14.199999809265137,
      14.227672576904297,
      14.265847206115723,
      14.35416316986084,
      14.475919723510742
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      64.05,
      447.92,
      537.06,
      467.44
    ],
    "text": "learned trial Judge appears to have misdirected himself regarding the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.199999809265137,
      14.4979248046875
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.61,
      469.29,
      537.37,
      531.04
    ],
    "text": "infirmity relating to the identification of accused-appellant by witness Ariyawansha and also his failure to make a positive dock identification, and whether it was safe to act on the identification, and whether it was",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.138216018676758,
      14.145646095275879,
      14.199999809265137,
      14.201099395751953,
      14.227672576904297,
      14.232213020324707,
      14.233560562133789,
      14.2535982131958,
      14.36306381225586,
      14.4979248046875,
      14.611827850341797,
      14.641098976135254
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.71,
      532.89,
      537.44,
      636.64
    ],
    "text": "safe to act on the Parade notes relating to witness Ariyawansha which is not substantive evidence and also considering that witness Thabrew had been shown to the accused-appellant. It was the contention of the Counsel for the Respondent that there was positive evidence not only with regard to the identification if the accused-appellant but also clear",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.38511848449707,
      14.188495635986328,
      14.199999809265137,
      14.224827766418457,
      14.264503479003906,
      14.331738471984863,
      14.35416316986084,
      14.39732837677002,
      14.4979248046875,
      14.611827850341797,
      14.631542205810547,
      14.868131637573242
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      63.93,
      638.48,
      537.07,
      658.0
    ],
    "text": "evidence as to the means of identification established by the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.456114768981934,
      14.199999809265137,
      14.4979248046875,
      14.611827850341797
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      64.52,
      659.36,
      148.62,
